// Remote detonation through rock: lever -> copperline -> thrummer, knocking through a 2 m granite wall to a
// listener on the same channel in the next chamber, whose copperline sets off the TNT there. The mole is safe.
map
####################################
#................########..........#
#................########..........#
#................########..........#
#................########..........#
#................########..........#
#............@...########..........#
####################################
end
give Tnt 1
give Thrummer 2
device 3 -6 -1 Lever
wire 4 -3 -1
device 5 1 -1 Tx
wire 6 13 -1
device 7 13 -1 Rx
device 8 17 -1 Tnt
expect 60 dev:1,-1,Tx == 1
expect 60 dev:13,-1,Rx == 1
expect 60 ev:Explode == 0
use 61 -6 -1
expect 63 on:1,-1 == 1
expect 70 ev:Explode == 1
expect 70 dev:17,-1,Tnt == 0
expect 90 hp == 100
